/ Shown in place of the content of a block that failed, below its heading
/ like the content, so the icons of the block stay next to it
- if @block_heading
  h3 = @block_heading
p#errorExplanation.dashboard-block-error
  - if @query_invalid
    = l :error_query_statement_invalid
  - else
    ' An error occurred while executing dashboard block
    = tag.i @block
    '  and has been logged. Please report this error to your Redmine administrator.
